        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "103b469f-1312-513b-93a3-2f32dc6c7e6a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: SAS Technical Services, SAS Group, Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag, SAS AB\n- People: Mats Jansson\n- Places: Arlanda, Stockholm, Solna Municipality, Sweden, SAS Frösundavik Office Building\n- Organizations: Governments of Sweden, Denmark, Norway\n- Roles: Chief Executive Officer\n\nFacts:\n- From 2007 to 2010, Mats Jansson was Chief Executive Officer of SAS Group.\n- SAS Group, also called Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag and SAS AB, is an airline holding company traded as SAS Group and headquartered in the SAS Frösundavik Office Building in Solna Municipality, Sweden.\n- The governments of Sweden, Denmark, and Norway partially own SAS Group with stakes of 21.4%, 14.3%, and 14.3%, respectively.\n- SAS Group owns the aviation services companies SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services, and SAS Technical Services.\n- SAS Technical Services is owned by SAS Group and provides aircraft technical maintenance to airlines both within and outside the SAS Group.\n- SAS Technical Services is headquartered at Arlanda outside Stockholm and has 3,600 employees.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a80abe5b-8842-524d-b3d2-f8e4156214d9",
        "text": "Page: SAS Technical Services. Sentence: The company is owned by the SAS Group and provides technical maintenance of aircraft to airlines in and outside the SAS Group.\nPage: SAS Technical Services. Sentence: It is headquartered at Arlanda outside Stockholm and has 3,600 employees.\nPage: SAS Group. Sentence: Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag (, Nasdaq: SAS , ), trading as SAS Group and SAS AB, is an airline holding company headquartered in the SAS Frösundavik Office Building in Solna Municipality, Sweden.\nPage: SAS Group. Sentence: It also owns the aviation services companies SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services, and SAS Technical Services.\nPage: SAS Group. Sentence: SAS Group is partially owned by the governments of Sweden, Denmark, and Norway, with a 21.4%, 14.3%, and 14.3% ownership, respectively.\nPage: Mats Jansson. Sentence: He was Chief Executive Officer of SAS Group from 2007 to 2010.",
